# Witness: the split written with its behavioural half first

The same false figure as the exchanged-halves witness, in the other word order. A single
pattern requiring the architecture half to appear textually first matches nothing at all here,
so no split is extracted and nothing is compared - a transposed figure in the review record,
which is the exact defect this component already found once.

The suite was 44 behavioural and 131 architecture tests.
